ate--empty" role="status"><span class="async-state__text">尚無 What-if 假設情境</span></div></div></section><section class="dashboard-region dashboard-region--injection" aria-labelledby="injection-heading"><h2 id="injection-heading" class="dashboard-region__heading">事件注入</h2><div class="dashboard-region__content dashboard-region__content--stacked"><div class="async-state async-state--empty" role="status"><span class="async-state__text">尚無事件注入內容</span></div></div></section></div></main><footer class="dashboard-footer" role="contentinfo"><p class="dashboard-footer__text">City Response Commander</p></footer></div>"`;

exports[`Injection terminal CORE_IDENTITY_CONFLICT snapshot > matches the injection terminal conflict snapshot > injection-terminal-core-identity-conflict 1`] = `"<div class="execution-panel"><h3 class="execution-panel__heading">執行狀態與失敗訊息</h3><div class="execution-panel__status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="async-state async-state--insufficient" role="status"><span class="async-state__text">尚無已提交的決策核心（data_status=insufficient_data）。這與執行狀態是兩件事：終端 CORE_IDENTITY_CONFLICT 正是「無核心 + processing_failed」的組合，因此以下執行摘要照實呈現。</span></div><section class="execution-panel__section" aria-labelledby="execution-projection-heading"><h4 id="execution-projection-heading" class="execution-panel__subheading">執行狀態 <span class="decision-badge decision-badge--readonly" role="note">唯讀投影（IdempotencyTable，前端不可變更）</span></h4><dl class="decision-field-list"><div class="decision-field"><dt class="decision-field__label">狀態判讀</dt><dd class="decision-field__value"><span data-testid="execution-status-label">處理失敗，終端且非可復原（processing_failed）</span></dd></div><div class="decision-field"><dt class="decision-field__label">execution.status（後端原值）</dt><dd class="decision-field__value"><span data-testid="execution-status">processing_failed</span></dd></div><div class="decision-field"><dt class="decision-field__label">execution.last_error</dt><dd class="decision-field__value"><span data-testid="execution-last-error">CORE_IDENTITY_CONFLICT</span></dd></div><div class="decision-field"><dt class="decision-field__label">execution.retryable</dt><dd class="decision-field__value"><span data-testid="execution-retryable">否</span></dd></div><div class="decision-field"><dt class="decision-field__label">execution.attempt_count</dt><dd class="decision-field__value"><span data-testid="execution-attempt-count">1</span></dd></div></dl><p class="execution-panel__note" data-testid="execution-last-error-explanation">DecisionCore identity 比對不符，fail-closed：不覆寫既有核心、不推送公眾告警、不進行 enrichment。此為終端狀態，租約復原條件不成立。</p><div class="decision-notice decision-notice--terminal" role="alert" data-testid="execution-terminal-notice"><strong>終端衝突（CORE_IDENTITY_CONFLICT）：</strong>此執行已終止且<strong>無法復原</strong>（\`retryable=false\`、\`recovery_stage=NONE\`）。 系統<strong>不會</strong>自動重試，介面亦<strong>不提供</strong>重試操作； 後續相同 \`idempotency_key\` 的注入請求一律回 <code>409 Conflict</code>，不會被視為一般錯誤或<code>500</code>。請改以人工核對事件來源後，以不同的官方事件識別重新處理。</div><p class="execution-panel__note" data-testid="execution-readonly-note">本區塊為 \`IdempotencyTable\` 的<strong>唯讀投影</strong>（FIX 1）：其狀態由後端 \`InjectFn\` 與 \`WorkflowStatusFn\` 依分區所有權寫入，前端<strong>無法</strong>修改，畫面上亦無任何可變更此狀態的操作。它<strong>不是</strong> \`DecisionCore\` 的一部分—— \`DecisionCore\` 為 \`immutable_after_commit\`，且不含任何 \`IdempotencyTable\` 狀態。</p></section><section class="execution-panel__section" aria-labelledby="injection-outcome-heading" data-testid="injection-outcome" data-outcome-kind="terminal_conflict"><h4 id="injection-outcome-heading" class="execution-panel__subheading">最近一次事件注入結果（POST /incidents/{event_id}/inject）</h4><div data-testid="injection-terminal-conflict"><div class="decision-notice decision-notice--terminal" role="alert" data-testid="execution-terminal-notice"><strong>409 Conflict（CORE_IDENTITY_CONFLICT）— 終端、非可復原。</strong>後端已記錄 \`status=processing_failed\`、\`retryable=false\`、\`recovery_stage=NONE\`。 系統<strong>不會</strong>自動重試，介面<strong>不提供</strong>重試操作， 且此結果<strong>不是</strong>一般錯誤、<strong>不是</strong> <code>500</code>： 相同 \`idempotency_key\` 的後續請求一律回 <code>409</code>。 請人工核對事件來源與既有決策核心後，改以正確的官方事件識別重新處理。</div></div><dl class="decision-field-list"><div class="decision-field"><dt class="decision-field__label">HTTP 狀態</dt><dd class="decision-field__value"><span data-testid="injection-http-status">409</span></dd></div><div class="decision-field"><dt class="decision-field__label">decision_id</dt><dd class="decision-field__value"><span data-testid="injection-decision-id">DEC_TPE_2026_ACC_001_fixed</span></dd></div><div class="decision-field"><dt class="decision-field__label">trace_id</dt><dd class="decision-field__value"><span data-testid="injection-trace-id">tr-snapshot-fixed-001</span></dd></div><div class="decision-field"><dt class="decision-field__label">回應 status 欄位</dt><dd class="decision-field__value"><span data-testid="injection-body-status">processing_failed</span></dd></div><div class="decision-field"><dt class="decision-field__label">error_code</dt><dd class="decision-field__value"><span data-testid="injection-error-code">CORE_IDENTITY_CONFLICT</span></dd></div><div class="decision-field"><dt class="decision-field__label">retryable</dt><dd class="decision-field__value"><span data-testid="injection-retryable">否</span></dd></div></dl></section><section class="execution-panel__section"><h4 class="execution-panel__subheading">最近 processing.failed 事件</h4><div class="async-state async-state--empty" role="status"><span class="async-state__text">尚未收到 processing.failed 事件</span></div></section><p class="decision-notice decision-notice--manual" role="alert">需人工確認：終端 CORE_IDENTITY_CONFLICT 無法由系統復原，必須由人工核對事件來源與既有決策核心後處置。</p></div>"`;

exports[`Publish confirmation state snapshot > matches the publish-confirmation (draft) snapshot > publish-confirmation-draft-state 1`] = `"<div class="alert-panel"><h3 class="alert-panel__heading">多語民眾簡訊</h3><div class="alert-panel__status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><section class="alert-panel__section" aria-labelledby="alert-trigger-heading"><h4 id="alert-trigger-heading" class="alert-panel__subheading">SOP 第 6 條觸發判定</h4><dl class="decision-field-list"><div class="decision-field"><dt class="decision-field__label">是否須多語發布</dt><dd class="decision-field__value"><span data-testid="alert-multilingual-required">是</span><span class="decision-badge decision-badge--deterministic" role="note">決定性核心值（LLM 不可改寫）</span></dd></div><div class="decision-field"><dt class="decision-field__label">觸發條款</dt><dd class="decision-field__value">第 1 條、第 2 條</dd></div></dl><p class="alert-panel__note">觸發判定與語言集合皆為後端決定性真值；本面板不重算漫遊比率門檻。</p></section><section class="alert-panel__section" aria-labelledby="alert-points-heading"><h4 id="alert-points-heading" class="alert-panel__subheading">訊息要點（R14.4）</h4><dl class="decision-field-list"><div class="decision-field"><dt class="decision-field__label">事故位置</dt><dd class="decision-field__value">光復南路與忠孝東路口南側</dd></div><div class="decision-field"><dt class="decision-field__label">事件狀態</dt><dd class="decision-field__value">Closed</dd></div><div class="decision-field"><dt class="decision-field__label">改道指引（主疏散）</dt><dd class="decision-field__value">RD_TPE_004</dd></div><div class="decision-field"><dt class="decision-field__label">預計延誤（分鐘）</dt><dd class="decision-field__value"><span data-testid="alert-ete-minutes">78.6</span></dd></div><div class="decision-field"><dt class="decision-field__label">已知下限（分鐘）</dt><dd class="decision-field__value">60</dd></div></dl></section><section class="alert-panel__section" aria-labelledby="alert-messages-heading"><h4 id="alert-messages-heading" class="alert-panel__subheading">各語言簡訊</h4><ul class="alert-panel__messages"><li class="alert-panel__message" data-language="zh" data-source="backend"><h5 class="alert-panel__message-heading">中文<span class="decision-badge decision-badge--ai" role="note">AI 生成文字（不得取代核心數值）</span></h5><p class="alert-panel__message-text">光復南路封閉，請改道 RD_TPE_004。</p></li><li class="alert-panel__message" data-language="en" data-source="backend"><h5 class="alert-panel__message-heading">English<span class="decision-badge decision-badge--ai" role="note">AI 生成文字（不得取代核心數值）</span></h5><p class="alert-panel__message-text">Road closed. Detour via RD_TPE_004.</p></li></ul></section><section class="alert-panel__section" aria-labelledby="alert-publish-heading"><h4 id="alert-publish-heading" class="alert-panel__subheading">一鍵發布狀態</h4><dl class="decision-field-list"><div class="decision-field"><dt class="decision-field__label">發布狀態</dt><dd class="decision-field__value"><span data-testid="publish-state">draft</span></dd></div><div class="decision-field"><dt class="decision-field__label">發布管道</dt><dd class="decision-field__value">CMS、SMS</dd></div><div class="decision-field"><dt class="decision-field__label">核准者</dt><dd class="decision-field__value">尚無資料</dd></div><div class="decision-field"><dt class="decision-field__label">發布者</dt><dd class="decision-field__value">尚無資料</dd></div><div class="decision-field"><dt class="decision-field__label">失敗原因</dt><dd class="decision-field__value">尚無資料</dd></div><div class="decision-field"><dt class="decision-field__label">樂觀鎖版本</dt><dd class="decision-field__value">1</dd></div><div class="decision-field"><dt class="decision-field__label">最後更新</dt><dd class="decision-field__value">2026-05-20 22:10</dd></div></dl><ol class="alert-panel__audit"><li class="alert-panel__audit-entry">2026-05-20 22:10｜commander-1｜create_draft｜尚無資料 → draft</li></ol><div class="alert-panel__publish-gate"><button type="button" class="alert-panel__publish-request">發布民眾簡訊…</button></div></section></div>"`;
